     "value": "Ubiquitously expressed in fetus and adult (PubMed:9722952). Highest expression in adult pancreas, liver, skeletal muscle (PubMed:12930836, PubMed:9722952). In fetus, highest expression in liver and lower levels in kidney, and lung (PubMed:12930836). Exclusively expressed in the glomeruli along the glomerular capillary walls (PubMed:19443642)"
    }
   ],
